V. 35. I have showed you-Bishops, by my example, 

  all things-And this among the rest; 

  that thus labouring-So far as the labours of your office allow you time; 

  ye ought to help the weak-Those who are disabled by sickness, or any bodily infirmity, from maintaining themselves by their own labour. 

  And to remember-Effectually, so as to follow it; 

  the word which he himself said-Without doubt his disciples remembered many of his words which are not recorded. 

  It is happier to give-To imitate God, and have him, as it were, indebted to us.
